{"jobs": [{"absolute_url": "https://careers.airbnb.com/positions/8163037?gh_jid=8163037", "data_compliance": [{"type": "gdpr", "requires_consent": false, "requires_processing_consent": false, "requires_retention_consent": false, "retention_period": null, "demographic_data_consent_applies": false}], "internal_job_id": 3532728, "location": {"name": "United States"}, "metadata": [{"id": 9245691, "name": "Is this job part of ACC?", "value": false, "value_type": "yes_no"}, {"id": 10216612, "name": "Workplace Type", "value": "Remote", "value_type": "single_select"}], "id": 8163037, "updated_at": "2026-08-31T17:22:56-04:00", "requisition_id": "ONE", "title": "Executive Producer", "company_name": "Airbnb", "first_published": "2026-08-31T17:22:56-04:00", "language": "en", "application_deadline": null, "content": "&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team is composed of both marketing and creative talent. We consider ourselves Airbnb’s storyteller, responsible for sharing our vision and product promise with hosts and guests around the world. We build Airbnb’s brand by providing education on new ways to live, travel, and experience the world. Our work spans campaign, social, product launch events, and product marketing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversight/leadership of the production team during all project phases: planning, pre-production, production and post-production.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create alignment amongst stakeholders and partners throughout the deliverable production process, holding production team members accountable. Work closely with Program Managers to align on creative development schedules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Executive Producers and Creative Operations to ensure the resourcing plan meets larger skillset needs of the project, cross-project contractor needs are identified and sourced.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage production project timelines and budgets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exhibit a passion for creative excellence on a daily basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure work is produced in line with the highest standards of quality; Ability to manage budgeting, resourcing, and timeline for large-scale, complex creative productions and concurrent workstreams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to strategic vision and have ownership in the quality of the final product.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report status of projects with Sr. Management in clear, concise fashion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build meaningful XFN relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and execute integrated productions (e.g., film, photography, native social, animation, activations etc.). Advocate diversity, equity, and inclusion across work, internal teams, and external partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 20+ years of relevant experience helping lead global creative campaigns, preferably a mix of advertising agency, creative studio, and in-house experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of production process and terminology; social channels and best practices spanning paid, organic, influencer and creator led workstreams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication and organizational skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience thriving in a fast-paced workplace. Ability to visualize a range of solutions rapidly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for process and time-management. Able to juggle tasks and prioritize.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive desire to understand and take pride in how your work contributes to the bigger picture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong track record of developing and managing a team, partnering closely with cross-functional partners/vendors- overseeing all aspects of the production process from start to finish - empowering individuals to achieve their best work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience presenting creative to C-Suite, with the ability to clearly articulate and defend creative ideas.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Software: Airtable, Google Sheets, and basic knowledge of Figma and Adobe Creative suite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This position is US - Remote Eligible. The role may include occasional work at an Airbnb office or attendance at offsites, as agreed to with your manager. While the position is Remote Eligible, you must live in a state where Airbnb, Inc. has a registered entity. &lt;a style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.airbnb.com/&quot;&gt;Click here for the up-to-date list of excluded states. This list is continuously evolving, so please check back with us if the state you live in is on the exclusion list.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; If your position is employed by another Airbnb entity, your recruiter will inform you what states you are eligible to work from.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Airbnb is committed to working with the broadest talent pool possible. We believe diverse ideas foster innovation and engagement, and allow us to attract creatively-led people, and to develop the best products, services and solutions. All qualified individuals are encouraged to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We strive to also provide a disability inclusive application and interview process. If you are a candidate with a disability and require reasonable accommodation in order to submit an application, please contact us at: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot; href=&quot;mailto:reasonableaccommodations@airbnb.com&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;reasonableaccommodations@airbnb.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. Please include your full name, the role you’re applying for and the accommodation necessary to assist you with the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;&quot;&gt;We ask that you only reach out to us if you are a candidate whose disability prevents you from being able to complete our online application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;How We&#39;ll Take Care of You:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay is dependent upon many factors, such as: training, transferable skills, work experience, business needs and market demands. The base pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. This role may also be eligible for bonus, equity, benefits, and Employee Travel Credits. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$196,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$245,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;", "departments": [{"id": 73692, "name": "Marketing & Creative", "child_ids": [254, 6427, 309, 294484], "parent_id": 60666}], "offices": [{"id": 63868, "name": "United States", "location": null, "child_ids": [246412, 258081, 258082, 258083, 87306, 87309, 211524, 87312, 87316, 87315, 104152, 88158, 85791, 87313, 88161, 87308, 87311, 87307, 80804, 109320, 87314, 88160, 78632, 87310, 88159, 241531, 108489, 62810, 62444, 85003, 104153, 12964, 11235, 55, 4447, 5924, 1316, 162, 5925, 1086, 1355], "parent_id": 17515}], "ai_disclaimer": null, "include_ai_disclaimer": null, "ai_opt_out_request_url": null}]}
